  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-d5c0384ed2b21e7036144424",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于 SRL 方程的任意根 s0，在 -s0 处也必有一个根。左半平面（LHP）中的轨迹在右半平面（RHP）中有镜像；即它们关于虚轴对称。与实传递函数 G0 的所有根轨迹一样，该轨迹也关于实轴对称。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For any root s0 of the SRL equation, there will also be a root at -s0. The locus in the LHP will have a mirror image in the RHP; that is, they are symmetric with respect to the imaginary axis. As with all root loci for real transfer functions G0, the locus is also symmetric with respect to the real axis.",
